  "details": "Every time I check my friends-list and try to order by status or name, almost half or more of my friends are missing from the list.\n\nI have to actually login the game to find out who is online and who isn't.\n\nThis has been an issue ever since rework of the friends-list on the website.\n\nIf you manually search for a friends who isn't showing as in-game or active on the website by their name, it will then show they are online, but once you clear the search field, they will still be hidden away from the In-World AND Active sections.",
